trader/exit_mechs_suspend.go:16: // Both mechanisms are LIVE and FIRING (full audit 09-01: 2 breakeven moves, 8
trader/exit_mechs_suspend.go:17: // trail ratchets that day) with NO measurement of whether they help. Round-7
trader/exit_mechs_suspend.go:18: // research ranks ATR/Chandelier trails in the worst group of 15 exit families
trader/exit_mechs_suspend.go:19: // across 567,000 backtests, and the net effect of breakeven moves is contested.
trader/exit_mechs_suspend.go:20: // Our own tape shows $719.50 of giveback with ZERO trail EXITS ever recorded.
trader/exit_mechs_suspend.go:21: //
trader/exit_mechs_suspend.go:22: // The problem is not the direction of the effect — it is that unmeasured
trader/exit_mechs_suspend.go:23: // mechanisms are moving live stops. Suspended (not deleted) until MFE data
trader/exit_mechs_suspend.go:24: // exists (wave 1A). Exits while suspended: fixed stop · fixed target · EOD flat
trader/exit_mechs_suspend.go:25: // · the existing invalidation/dormant logic.
trader/exit_mechs_suspend.go:26: //
trader/exit_mechs_suspend.go:27: // Env EXIT_MECHS_SUSPENDED=0 re-enables both (the knobs are retained; per-
trader/exit_mechs_suspend.go:28: // strategy breakeven_enabled / trailing_enabled still gate them underneath).
trader/exit_mechs_suspend.go:29:
